## 3. Unreal Engine 5 Headless Cook & Package

Automate UE5 builds using `RunUAT.sh` (Unreal Automation Tool):

```bash
"$UE5_DIR/Engine/Build/BatchFiles/RunUAT.sh" BuildCookRun \
  -project="$(pwd)/MyGame.uproject" \
  -platform=Linux \
  -clientconfig=Shipping \
  -cook \
  -build \
  -stage \
  -package \
  -archive \
  -archivedirectory="$(pwd)/dist" \
  -nocompileeditor \
  -nop4
```
